greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.slimy_shotTrait.name=Sticky Shot
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.slimy_shotTrait.desc=§oOops, they stuck together...\n§rChance to fire multiple arrows at once (up to 3).
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.soul_takerTrait.name=Soul Taker
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.soul_takerTrait.desc=§oHow did you even see me?!\n§rDeals triple damage to invisible targets.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.spectual_arrowTrait.name=Spectual Arrow
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.spectual_arrowTrait.desc=§oJust like the Spectral Arrow!\n§rArrows apply the Glowing effect.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.cushioningTrait.name=Cushioning
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.cushioningTrait.desc=§oA steady shot\n§rImproves arrow accuracy.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.chemicalTrait.name=Chemical
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.chemicalTrait.desc=§oBulk commodity.\n§rArrows deal more damage based on the number of potion effects on the target.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.oscillationTrait.name=Oscillation
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.oscillationTrait.desc=§oPull it a few more times!\n§rWhen fired, arrows push back entities in the player's facing direction.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.bloody_arrowTrait.name=Bloody Arrow
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.bloody_arrowTrait.desc=§oForged from blood.\n§rEach time you take damage, your next shot gains 1 extra arrow, up to 5.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.bloody_arrow2Trait.name=Bloody Arrow II
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.bloody_arrow2Trait.desc=§oForged from blood.\n§rEach time you take damage, your next shot gains 2 extra arrows, up to 10.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.frightened_trait.name=Frightened
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.frightened_trait.desc=§oFrighten them off!\n§rEnemies hit by arrows have a chance to change their aggro target.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.shroudTrait.name=Shroud
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.shroudTrait.desc=§oThe gods of ancient Egypt\n§rDoubles arrow damage and slows the target, but inflicts paralysis on you for the same duration.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.flamebowTrait.name=Flamebow
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.flamebowTrait.desc=§oI may be old, but my arrows are still sharp!\n§rHolding this bow in your off-hand tracks the distinct damage types you deal to a target. The more types recorded, the higher the damage bonus when firing — up to 8x.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.webbingTrait.name=Webbing
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.webbingTrait.desc=§oA gift from the spiders!\n§rArrows spawn cobwebs on impact.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.flashbackTrait.name=Flashback
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.flashbackTrait.desc=§oAn echo through space and time!\n§rApplies 10 seconds of Invisibility to both the target and yourself.
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.bloodecayTrait.name=Bloodecay
greedycraft.tconstruct.bow_trait.bloodecayTrait.desc=§oBlood, carnage — it makes me boil!\n§rAfter each shot, the target's remaining health percentage affects how much max health your next hit shaves off — the lower their health, the higher the cut!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.reachTrait.name=Reach
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.reachTrait.desc=§oThe arms of an angel!\n§rWhile wearing this armor, you can interact from a greater distance.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bloodlustTrait.name=Bloodlust
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bloodlustTrait.desc=§oThe call of blood!§r\n§fYour armor loses durability at triple speed, but you recover 3 health each time it does.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.barrier_toughTrait.name=Barrier
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.barrier_toughTrait.desc=§oImpregnable defense!§r\n§fIncreases armor toughness by 10%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.rejectionTrait.name=Rejection
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.rejectionTrait.desc=§oStay away from me!§r\n§fPushes nearby enemies back every 5 seconds.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dubhe_nightTrait.name=Dubhe (Night)
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dubhe_nightTrait.desc=§oLeading star of the Big Dipper!§r\n§fSame effect as the "Night Dubhe Helmet", but increases damage taken.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dubhe_lightTrait.name=Dubhe (Day)
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dubhe_lightTrait.desc=§oLeading star of the Big Dipper!§r\n§fSame effect as the "Day Dubhe Helmet", but reduces your armor value.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.wolf_roarTrait.name=Wolf Roar
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.wolf_roarTrait.desc=§oDuring the full moon...\n§rGrants a small amount of extra defense during full moons.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.floatingTrait.name=Floating
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.floatingTrait.desc=§oLightly I drift away...§r\n§fMakes the player levitate while sneaking.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.antilevitationTrait.name=Antilevitation
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.antilevitationTrait.desc=§oSeems a bit useless?\n§rImmunity to levitation.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.endershellTrait.name=Endershell
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.endershellTrait.desc=§oBlessed by the Endermen!§r\n§fGreatly reduces damage dealt by Ender-type mobs.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.cryonicTrait.desc=§oLet it go!§r\n§fSlows down attackers when taken damage!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.cryonicTrait.name=Cryonic
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.crystalTrait.desc=§oKeep it shiny!§r\n§fReduces taken damage when durability is almost full, but increases damage when at low durability.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.crystalTrait.name=Crystal Force
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.enduranceTrait.desc=§oThat didn't even hurt me!§r\n§fGreatly reduces damage that is lower than 5% of your max health!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.enduranceTrait.name=Enduring
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.firstGuardTrait.desc=§oIt's my turn now!§r\n§fReduces taken damage when at full health!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.firstGuardTrait.name=First Guard
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.firstGuard2Trait.name=First Guard II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.fortifiedTrait.desc=§oThicc Armor!§r\n§fIncreases protection against projectiles!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.fortifiedTrait.name=Fortified
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.gambleTrait.desc=§oPray to RNGesus!§r\n§fThere's a chance to reduce 50% of damage, and a lower chance to get 2x of the damage... depends on RNG!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.gambleTrait.name=Gambling
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.holdGroundTrait.desc=§oWe shall not retreat!§r\n§fReduces damage and nullifies knockback when sneaking.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.holdGroundTrait.name=Hold the Ground
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.infernoTrait.desc=§oBuilt with fire!§r\n§fHave a chance to ignite attackers!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.infernoTrait.name=Inferno
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.knowledgefulTrait.desc=§oKnowledge is power!§r\n§fReduces damage according to your experience level, caps at 300 lvls!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.knowledgefulTrait.name=Shield of Knowledge
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.kungfuTrait.desc=§oGuess where I am!§r\n§fHave a chance to dodge attack and gain a short speed boost, but you become more vulnerable to child mobs due to their sharp vision.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.kungfuTrait.name=Phasing
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.levelingdefenseTrait.desc=§oGo big or go home!§r\n§fIncreases damage reduction according to your armor's level.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.levelingdefenseTrait.name=Leveled Defense
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.luckyTrait.desc=§oI'm the RNG god!§r\n§fBecome lucky when wearing this armor!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.luckyTrait.name=Lucky
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.milkyTrait.desc=§oI have a strong immune system!§r\n§fOccasionally clears all potion effects (even the good ones)
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.milkyTrait.name=Milky
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.motionTrait.desc=§oNewton's second law!§r\n§fReduces damage when sprinting but you become easier to be knocked back!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.motionTrait.name=Motion
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.perfectionistTrait.desc=§oIt' perfect like a masterpiece!§r\n§fRounds damage to the nearest multiply of 5 (Does not apply to damage below 5 points, and some calculations are done after rounding)
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.perfectionistTrait.name=Perfectionist
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.poopTrait.desc=§oWhy would you even do that?§r\n§fJust imagine wearing this...
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.poopTrait.name=Stinky
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.purifyingTrait.desc=§oBlossoms!§r\n§fGrants immunity to wither effect!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.purifyingTrait.name=Purifying
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.purifying2Trait.name=Purifying II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.secondLifeTrait.desc=§oWelcome to the afterlife!§r\n§fWhen taken fatal damage that wouldn't kill you at full health, there's a chance to nullify the damage and become invincible for a short period.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.secondLifeTrait.name=Second Life
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.spartanTrait.desc=§oTHIS IS SPARTAAA!§r\n§fReduces damage taken when at low health!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.spartanTrait.name=Spartan's Rage
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.thronyTrait.desc=§oAwww that hurts!§r\n§fAttackers also take a small amount of damage!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.thronyTrait.name=Thorny
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.tidalForceTrait.desc=§oI'm the §m§oSeaman§r§oAquaman!§r\n§fBreathe under water!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.tidalForceTrait.name=Tidal Force
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.trueDefenseTrait.desc=§oTrue damage sucks!§r\n§fReduces true damage taken!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.trueDefenseTrait.name=True Defense
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.visionTrait.desc=§oSee through the darkness!§r\n§fGrant night vision effect to the wearer!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.visionTrait.name=Vision
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.warmTrait.desc=§oDo not get cold!§r\n§fReduces damage taken in cold biomes, works better when snowing!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.warmTrait.name=Warm
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.vaccineTrait.name=Vaccine
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.vaccineTrait.desc=§oDoes not cause autism!§r\n§fGrants immunity to coralium plague.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.strongVaccineTrait.name=Strong Vaccine
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.strongVaccineTrait.desc=§oSecond Dose!§r\n§fGrants immunity to coralium plague and dread plague.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.warpDrainTrait.name=Warp Drain
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.warpDrainTrait.desc=§oGoodbye Warp!§r\n§fOccasionally drains your warp and turns it into a random positive buff! (Non-temporary warp is harder to drain and permanent warp can't be drained)
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.foglightTrait.name=Foglight
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.foglightTrait.desc=§oThe fog is so thick!§r\n§fAt altitudes below 40, your adrenaline naturally starts pumping?
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overrestrainTrait.name=Overrestrain
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overrestrainTrait.desc=§oNeither good nor bad.\n§rBonus when below 70% health!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.elementfriendlyTrait.name=Elemental Affinity
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.elementfriendlyTrait.desc=§oIn the name of the elements.\n§rNo one knows how these tiny particles actually work.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.geneticevolutionTrait.name=Genetic Evolution
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.geneticevolutionTrait.desc=§oBlocked it in an instant!\n§rWhen you take damage, you have a chance to dodge.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.geneticevolutionTrait2.name=Genetic Evolution II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.geneticevolutionTrait2.desc=§oBlocked it in an instant!\n§rWhen you take damage, you have a chance to dodge.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.disappearingTrait.name=Disappearing
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.disappearingTrait.desc=§oFading into nothingness...\n§rInvisibility!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.twilightarmor1Trait.name=Twilight Guardian I
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.twilightarmor2Trait.name=Twilight Guardian II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.twilightarmor3Trait.name=Twilight Guardian III
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.twilightarmor4Trait.name=Twilight Guardian IV
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.twilightarmor5Trait.name=Twilight Guardian V
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.twilightarmorTrait.desc=§oRight at home in the Twilight Forest!\n§rYour defense is boosted in the Twilight dimension.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.nightmareTrait.name=Nightmare Tide
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.nightmareTrait.desc=§oStronger defense.\n§rDamage taken decreases as your health increases!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.timeturnTrait.name=Timeturn
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.timeturnTrait.desc=§oEat dust, loser!\n§rTime reverses!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.soul_absourceTrait.name=Soul Absource
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.soul_absourceTrait.desc=§oThe power of knowledge: are you polite?\n§rEach time you take damage, consume experience to resist a large portion of it!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.void_walkTrait.name=Void Walk
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.void_walkTrait.desc=§oReminds me of the Void Enchant on Hypixel...\n§rMakes you levitate when falling into the void.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.void_radiationTrait.name=Void Radioactive
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.void_radiationTrait.desc=§oI said it once, there are no Titan mobs!\n§rContinuously applies Wither to nearby non-player entities.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.icy_armorTrait.name=Icy Armor
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.icy_armorTrait.desc=§oZadkiel — Tyrion!\n§rFreezes attackers.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.self_poisonTrait.name=Self Poison
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.self_poisonTrait.desc=§oYou tried to harm others but hurt yourself...\n§rYour armor's toxicity is so potent, even you suffer its backlash!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.poison_smogTrait.name=Poison Smog
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.poison_smogTrait.desc=§oPoison mist swirls around you.\n§rOn hit, generates a radius-3 potion cloud (Poison X, 10s); you are immune to Poison. Unenvenomed attackers receive Poison VIII for 5s; envenomed attackers deal 20–40% less damage to you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.old_ones_barrierTrait.name=Old One's Barrier
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.old_ones_barrierTrait2.name=Old One's Barrier II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.old_ones_barrierTrait.desc=§oThe blessing of the Ancient Ones.\n§rGreatly increases armor toughness.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.permanent_antibodyTrait.name=Permanent Antibody
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.permanent_antibodyTrait.desc=§oA stronger, better vaccine.\n§rImmunity to damage from Plague, Coralium Plague, and Dread Plague.
