greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.electric_shockTrait.name=Electric Shock
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.electric_shockTrait.desc=§oBuzz buzz buzz.\n§rWhen you take damage, conducts it to all nearby mobs.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.IAmetalTrait.name=Alkali Metal
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.IAmetalTrait2.name=Alkali Metal II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.IAmetalTrait.desc=§oFloat. Melt. Swim. Fizz. Red.\n§rWhen taking damage from a water source: if you are in water, damage increases; if the attacker is in water, damage taken is greatly reduced!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.unstableTrait.name=Unstable
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.unstableTrait.desc=§oBOOM!\n§rHighly flammable and explosive!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.changeableTrait.name=Changeable
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.changeableTrait.desc=§oWatch me shapeshift!\n§rWhen you take damage, it is randomly multiplied by 0.5 to 1.5.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.specific_immunityTrait.name=Plague Immunity
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.specific_immunityTrait.desc=§oNo longer afraid of pathogens!\n§rImmunity to damage from Plague, Coralium Plague, Dread Plague, and Abyssal Plague.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.timedefenceTrait.name=Time Defence
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.timedefenceTrait.desc=§oRiding the waves of time!\n§rDamage taken follows a 10-day cycle of reduction and amplification.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bellyfulTrait.name=Bellyful
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bellyfulTrait.desc=§oAhh, I can't eat another bite...\n§rFills your belly!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.healthshieldTrait.name=Health Shield
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.healthshield2Trait.name=Health Shield II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.healthshieldTrait.desc=§oI can take a beating!\n§rConsumes LP to block part of damage taken; if LP is insufficient, you take extra damage instead!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.healthshield2Trait.desc=§oI can take a beating!\n§rConsumes a large amount of LP to block part of damage taken!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.soul_ascendTrait.name=Soul Ascend
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.soul_ascendTrait.desc=§oTurning trash into treasure!\n§rWhile afflicted by the Blaze Curse, gain continuous health regeneration.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.pyrophoricTrait.name=Pyrophoric
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.pyrophoricTrait.desc=§oFFF\n§rTake the name literally.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.stripeTrait.name=Stripe
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.stripeTrait.desc=§oAbsorb the impact!\n§rAbsorbs a portion of damage and converts it into a smaller amount of magic damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.heaven_guardTrait.name=Heaven Guard
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.heaven_guardTrait.desc=§oHeaven is watching!\n§rGrants a buff when in the open sky.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.give_spirit_backTrait.name=Give Spirit Back
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.give_spirit_backTrait.desc=§oThe negative outweighs the positive.\n§rWhen taking damage, chance to negate most of it — but 2 ghosts spawn around you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ghostmovingTrait.name=Ghost Step
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ghostmovingTrait.desc=§oIs it really that smooth?\n§rWhen hit, tiny chance to dodge and gain a brief Speed effect.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.cooperationTrait.name=Cooperation
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.cooperationTrait.desc=§oUnited we stand!\n§rWhile equipping both armor and a weapon with this trait, gain 35% damage reduction.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.tieringTrait.name=Tiering
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.tieringTrait.desc=§oTrade what you lose!\n§rReduces attack damage, increases defense.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.climbTrait.name=Climb
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.climbTrait.desc=§oJust like a spider.\n§rYou can climb walls.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.light_markTrait.name=Light Mark
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.light_markTrait.desc=§oShine bright!\n§rApplies the Glowing effect.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.rushingTrait.name=Rushing
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.rushingTrait.desc=§oBreaking through like bamboo!\n§rApplies Weakness to all mobs in a small area.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dangerousTrait.name=Dangerous
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dangerousTrait.desc=§oWhy would you do this?\n§rThe lower your health, the higher the Resistance boost you receive.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.againstTrait.name=Against
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.againstTrait.desc=§oHey, don't do that.\n§rWhen taking heavy damage, briefly gain Strength and Resistance.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.meteor_fallTrait.name=Meteor Fall
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.meteor_fallTrait.desc=§oA s t e r o i d  F a l l i n g\n§rChance to obtain a Fallen Star when attacked.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.antiwaterTrait.name=Antiwater
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.antiwaterTrait.desc=§oNo, I hate it!\n§rAs everyone knows, water is deadly poison.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.promiseTrait.name=Promise
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.promiseTrait.desc=§oNever give up.\n§rGain Absorption X every ten seconds!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.inserveTrait.name=Inserve
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.inserveTrait.desc=§o—!on ,oN\n§r!stceffe sutats setrevnI
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.strongdefenseTrait.name=Absolute Defense
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.strongdefenseTrait.desc=§oA true shield!\n§rIncreases armor value.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.magic_fusionTrait.name=Magic Focus
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.magic_fusionTrait.desc=§oNice.\n§rEnhances your magic damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.helpful_radiationTrait.name=Helpful Radiation
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.helpful_radiationTrait.desc=§oThis stuff can actually be beneficial.\n§rGrants random positive effects.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.true_limitingTrait.name=True Limiting
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.true_limitingTrait.desc=§oStronger and better than Limiting!\n§rBlocks excess damage!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.barrierTrait.name=Barrier
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.barrierTrait.desc=§oShut out everything around you!\n§rThis armor will occasionally deflect nearby entities.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.thadTrait.name=Artisan's Will
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.thadTrait.desc=§oPerhaps you should try...\n§bGodscraft — Synergy Trait\n§rThe more Tinkers' traits your armor has, the higher the damage reduction.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.counterattackTrait.name=Counterattack
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.counterattackTrait.desc=§oForged through combat!\n§rWhen damaged by an entity, chance to heal HP equal to 1% of the attacker's current health — and the attacker heals HP equal to your current health in return.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.falldownTrait.name=Falldown
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.falldownTrait.desc=§oJustice from above!\n§rImmunity to all fall damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.penetrationTrait.name=Penetration
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.penetrationTrait.desc=§oI once heard of a metal that tears through aluminum alloys...\n§rWhen taking damage, consumes Aluminum Ingots from your inventory to negate 40% of the damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.sunnyTrait.name=Sunny
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.sunnyTrait.desc=§oReally, it comes in handy sometimes.\n§rWhen taking damage, chance to change the weather to clear.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aura_infusedTrait.name=Aura Infused
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aura_infusedTrait.desc=§oDon't over-exploit the environment!\n§rActively stores Aura in high-Aura areas, then repairs armor durability using stored Aura!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.full_of_auraTrait.name=Full of Aura
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.full_of_auraTrait.desc=§oFull release!\n§rRestores a certain amount of Aura when taking damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aura_effectTrait.name=Aura Effect
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aura_effectTrait.desc=§oEnough. Maybe...\n§rReduces damage taken in areas with low Aura.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.correctingTrait.name=Correcting
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.correctingTrait.desc=§oError detected!\n§rWhen hit, small chance to become immune to all physical damage for 3 seconds.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.air_protectionTrait.name=Air Protection
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.air_protectionTrait.desc=§oAnti-air defense!\n§rReduces damage from airborne attackers; the greater the height difference, the lower the damage taken.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.active_sourceTrait.name=Active Source
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.active_source2Trait.name=Active Source II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.active_source3Trait.name=Active Source III
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.active_source4Trait.name=Active Source IV
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.active_source5Trait.name=Active Source V
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.active_source6Trait.name=Active Source VI
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.active_sourceTrait.desc=§oShare the radiation!\n§rThis equipment is radioactive!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.asleepTrait.name=Asleep
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.asleepTrait.desc=§oHmm? I'm paying attention.§r\n§fReduces damage taken from bosses.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.windyTrait.name=Windy
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.windyTrait.desc=§oMay the swift wind ever be at your side.\n§rWhile sprinting, continuously gain increasing Speed bonuses.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.pe_infusionTrait.name=PE Infusion
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.pe_infusionTrait.desc=§oA walking statue!\n§rActively collects and solidifies Potential Energy while in the Abyss Dimension.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.power_decreaseTrait.name=Power Decrease
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.power_decreaseTrait.desc=§oDisperse the force!\n§rWhen taking damage, releases energy into nearby stone, mitigating part of the damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.comfortTrait.name=Comfort
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.comfortTrait.desc=§oThe same attribute as elite mobs!\n§rWhen continuously attacked by the same type of mob, reduce that damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.soul_callingTrait.name=Soul Calling
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.soul_callingTrait.desc=§oNot a curse.\n§rChance to be attached by a soul that will block one attack for you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.undefeatableTrait.name=Undefeatable
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.undefeatableTrait.desc=§oWhat a lifesaver!\n§rThe more negative effects on you, the less damage you take.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.oxylessTrait.name=Oxyless
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.oxylessTrait.desc=§oIt slowly crumbles to powder...\n§rSlowly "oxidizes" over time; the more oxidized, the greater the damage reduction... but your armor degrades faster too.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.levitatedTrait.name=Levitated
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.levitatedTrait.desc=§oThe Overworld has been destroyed... sorry, wrong channel.\n§bWeightlessness — Synergy Trait\n§rWeightlessness. Take it literally.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.astralingTrait.name=Astraling
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.astralingTrait.desc=§oTwinkle twinkle little star!\n§rThis armor can resonate at the Resonance Altar!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.taintedTrait.name=Corruption
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.taintedTrait.desc=§oRotten!\n§rReduces a small amount of damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.erosionTrait.name=Erosion
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.erosionTrait.desc=§oWhat a strange smell...\n§rThis item may not do you any good.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.nucleus_of_betweenlandTrait.name=Nucleus of Betweenland
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.nucleus_of_betweenlandTrait.desc=§oThe Betweenlands!\n§rGains buffs while in the Betweenlands...
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.nucleus_of_betweenland2Trait.name=Nucleus of Betweenland II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.nucleus_of_betweenland2Trait.desc=§oThe Betweenlands!\n§rGains buffs while in the Betweenlands, plus automatic Decay recovery.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ethernalTrait.name=Ethernal
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ethernalTrait.desc=§oUnbreakable.\n§rNever loses durability.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.fascicledTrait.name=Fascicled
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.fascicledTrait.desc=§oBrought together!\n§rEnhance using Pharolite Crystal Clusters!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.splitTrait.name=Split
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.splitTrait.desc=§oI  s h a t t e r\n§rExtremely small chance to sacrifice armor durability to block damage!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.pharmacologyTrait.name=Pharmacology
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.pharmacologyTrait.desc=§oHow does it work?\n§rI am the Betweenlands Alchemist!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.element_forceTrait.name=Element Force
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.element_forceTrait.desc=§oResonating with the three elements...\n§rWhen attacked, chance to awaken the power of three gems! (Whether it triggers is entirely up to you, of course.)
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.stackedTrait.name=Stacked
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.stackedTrait.desc=§oOne more layer of defense!\n§rProvides bonus defense based on your maximum health!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.containmentTrait.name=Containment
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.containmentTrait.desc=§oOne-time use!\n§rWhen taking massive damage, your armor breaks... then absorbs that hit for you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.extra_healthTrait.name=Extra Health
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.extra_healthTrait.desc=§oA true miracle worker!\n§rWhen durability is consumed, chance to restore a large amount of durability...
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.land_of_illusionTrait.name=Land of Illusion
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.land_of_illusionTrait.desc=§oLet us step into this illusory world.§r\nEach time you're attacked, chance to become immune to that hit and enter a phantasmal state.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.parasitismTrait.name=Parasitism
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.parasitismTrait.desc=§oConsumes your armor!\n§bParasite Tech — Synergy Trait\n§rOccupies the slots of other Tinkers' traits... to sustain itself\n§oDevours other traits; becomes void if any component is replaced — choose your build carefully.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aethericTrait.name=Aetheric
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aethericTrait.desc=§oThe power of the sky!\n§rIncreases defense while in the Aether.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.turtle_defenseTrait.name=Turtle Defense
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.turtle_defenseTrait.desc=§oCowardly!\n§rIf the product of your opponent's armor value and Resistance level exceeds your own armor, their damage to you is multiplied by 0.75.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.funeral_armorTrait.name=Funeral Armor
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.funeral_armorTrait.desc=§oTake them with you when you go.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.restlamentTrait.name=Restlament
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.restlamentTrait.desc=§oA funeral calls for solemnity.§r\nReduces the effectiveness of undead mob attacks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.slowdownTrait.name=Slowdown
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.slowdownTrait.desc=§oAbsorb the radiation!\n§rEach piece of armor reduces the "Active Source" attribute by 20%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.antiterrorismTrait.name=Antiterrorism
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.antiterrorismTrait.desc=§oReject terrorism.\n§rImmune to 80% of explosion damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overdominateTrait.name=Overdominate
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overdominateTrait.desc=§oThe supreme ruler... sort of.\n§rYour slime coat will provide extra defense!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.wyvernTrait.name=Wyvern
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.wyvernTrait.desc=§oAccording to Ender Dragon kinetic research!\n§rReduces damage taken from the Ender Dragon by 30%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.fallenTrait.name=Fallen
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.fallenTrait.desc=§oAccording to Wither biology research!\n§rReduces damage taken from the Wither by 30%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.draconicTrait.name=Draconic
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.draconicTrait.desc=§oAccording to Ender Dragon kinetic research! 2.0?\n§rReduces damage taken from the Ender Dragon by 50%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.relifedTrait.name=Relifed
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.relifedTrait.desc=§oAccording to Wither biology research! 2.0?\n§rReduces damage taken from the Wither by 50%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.chaoticTrait.name=Chaotic
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.chaoticTrait.desc=§oOne more added to the mix!\n§rReduces Ender Dragon damage by 60%; reduces Chaos Guardian damage by 50%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.stormyTrait.name=Stormy
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.stormyTrait.desc=§oOne more added to the mix! 2.0\n§rReduces Wither damage by 60%; reduces Wither Storm damage by 50%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.orderedTrait.name=Ordered
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.orderedTrait.desc=§oNice, balanced.\n§rReduces damage taken from all bosses by 40%!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.globiomeTrait.name=Globiome
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.globiomeTrait.desc=§oTime to explorrrrrre\n§rBiomes you've visited will strengthen your armor!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.leveling_durabilityTrait.name=Leveling Durability
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.leveling_durabilityTrait.desc=§oNow say: Thanks ED!\n§rArmor durability loss is affected by game difficulty.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.recureTrait.name=Recure
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.recureTrait.desc=§oSurvive the worst, and fortune follows.\n§rWhen hit, if you can survive for a few more seconds... you recover some health.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.arcaneTrait.name=Arcane
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.arcaneTrait.desc=§oPeculiar...\n§rNight is somewhat beneficial to armor durability.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.blindTrait.name=Blind
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.blindTrait.desc=§oOn a pitch-black night, I can't see a thing!\n§rDarkness inflicts Weakness and Blindness on you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.copyTrait.name=Copy
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.copyTrait.desc=§oCtrl+C!\n§rRestores durability when you gain experience.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.darkTrait.name=Darkness
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.darkTrait.desc=§oNight makes you a fiercer fighter.\n§rIncreases armor value at night.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.hydrogen_absorbTrait.name=Hydrogen Absorb
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.hydrogen_absorbTrait.desc=§oNot a catalyst!\n§rCan be used as a fuel cell!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dissolvingTrait.name=Dissolving
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dissolvingTrait.desc=§oI don't care about losing experience.\n§rThis is no longer adventure mode :(
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.superheavyTrait.name=Superheavy
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.superheavyTrait.desc=§oSo heavy... I can barely breathe...\n§rYour jump height is reduced, but you become more resilient.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.sectionalTrait.name=Sectional
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.sectionalTrait.desc=§oThis isn't kicking someone when they're down!\n§rWhen your armor durability is low, your defense is higher... but durability drains faster too.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.specializationTrait.name=Specialization
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.specializationTrait.desc=§oIn short: rob Peter to pay Paul.\n§rWeakens other resistances to boost physical resistance!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.emperoricTrait.name=Emperoric
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.emperoricTrait.desc=§oI am the king!\n§rIncreases armor and armor toughness by 20%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.enthusiasticTrait.name=Enthusiastic
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.enthusiasticTrait.desc=§oI'm absolutely hyped right now~~~~\n§rMakes all nearby targets more "active" (meaning Strength).
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.revivalingTrait.name=Revivaling
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.revivalingTrait.desc=§oEqual treatment for all?\n§rA walking healing potion!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.natureboundTrait.name=Nature Bound
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.natureboundTrait.desc=§oYou become one with nature!\n§rRestore in the name of nature.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.portedTrait.name=Ported
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.portedTrait.desc=§oA bit too cautious...\n§rWhen you would take lethal damage, teleports you to the ground (5-min cooldown).
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.panoramaTrait.name=Panorama
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.panoramaTrait.desc=§oAll-encompassing.\n§rDamage from non-vanilla mobs is reduced.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bedrockTrait.name=Bedrock
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bedrockTrait.desc=§oImmovable as bedrock!\n§rYour armor only has a 15% chance to consume durability.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overbreakTrait.name=Overbreak
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overbreakTrait.desc=§o...until death do us part.\n§rIn destruction, there is new life...
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overbounceTrait.name=Overbounce
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overbounceTrait.desc=§o100% collagen!\n§rGain supercharged jump power, but... you lose some slime.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overdefenseTrait.name=Overdefense
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overdefenseTrait.desc=§oFor this is the Yangtze, an unassailable fortress...\n§rWhen your armor's slime coat falls below 5% of max durability, you gain 4 extra armor.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overreflectTrait.name=Overreflect
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overreflectTrait.desc=§oT h e  K i n g  c i r c l e s  t h e  p i l l a r\n§rWhen attacked, transfers negative effects to the attacker.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overfusedTrait.name=Overfused
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.overfusedTrait.desc=§oA sticky barrier!\n§rImmune to most attacks from slime-type mobs!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.enhancedTrait.name=Enhanced
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.enhancedTrait.desc=§oShining bright!\n§rAdds 2 upgrade slots.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.loveTrait.name=Love
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.loveTrait.desc=§oDamare! No funny business!\n§rPuts you in rut. (Decorative only)
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.orthogonalityTrait.name=Orthogonality
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.orthogonalityTrait.desc=§oVertically useless!\n§rImmune to damage from vertical directions.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.diffractionTrait.name=Diffraction
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.diffractionTrait.desc=§oKeep it moving!\n§rConverts damage you've already taken into health!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.emberTrait.name=Ember
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.emberTrait.desc=§oMake the most of what's left!\n§rUses durability to compensate for combat power.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.rekindledTrait.name=Rekindled
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.rekindledTrait.desc=§oWild fire rises again.\n§rRestores a large amount of durability while burning.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.sutureTrait.name=Suture
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.sutureTrait.desc=§oApologies, there was a slight complication during surgery...\n§rIncreases movement speed! But durability drains more easily...
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ripeningTrait.name=Ripening
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ripeningTrait.desc=§oGoodbye, Decay!\n§rGains the Ripening effect while in swamp water.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.underwaterregenTrait.name=Underwater Regen
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.underwaterregenTrait.desc=§oRevived by the hot spring?\n§rMovement speed greatly reduced in water, but... health regenerates rapidly (really rapidly).
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.collapseTrait.name=Collapse
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.collapseTrait.desc=§oAbsolutely has nothing to do with a certain game...\n§rYour armor breaks down rapidly.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.scalesTrait.name=Scales
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.scalesTrait.desc=§oUnwavering resilience!\n§rIncreases armor and armor toughness.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.primordial_malevolenceTrait.name=Primordial Malevolence
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.primordial_malevolenceTrait.desc=§oWhich boss is this from?\n§rWhen damaged, small chance to additionally drain your health.\n§rThis seems... undesirable.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.watcherTrait.name=Watcher
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.watcherTrait.desc=§oBound by ancient emptiness.\n§rReduces a small amount of magic and physical damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.world_beginningTrait.name=World Beginning
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.world_beginningTrait.desc=§oWelcome to the new world.\n§rFor a period after entering a new dimension, reduces damage taken.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.abstractTrait.name=Abstract
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.abstractTrait.desc=§oThis is definitely not a good word.\n§rWhen the first decimal digit of damage taken is 1, 4, or 7, that damage is halved.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.hachimi_roarTrait.name=Hachimi Roar
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.hachimi_roarTrait.desc=§oThe rage of the elderly!\n§r↓↓↓↑ HA!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.wight_absorptionTrait.name=Wight Absorption
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.wight_absorptionTrait.desc=§oIgnore the hindrance of evil spirits!\n§rWights can no longer deal any damage to you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.calamityTrait.name=Calamity
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.calamityTrait.desc=§oCalamity strikes!\n§rWhen attacked, high chance to inflict random negative effects on the attacker.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.broken_armorTrait.name=Broken Armor
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.broken_armorTrait.desc=§oStrange armor!\n§rReduces magic damage by 50%, increases physical damage taken by 100%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.malevolence_catalystTrait.name=Malevolence Catalyst
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.malevolence_catalystTrait.desc=§oThe source of malevolence!\n§rIncreases the conversion efficiency of Malevolent Steel Ingots...
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.flops_overclockTrait.name=Flops Overclock
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.flops_overclockTrait.desc=§oBecome the machine!\n§bNova Engineering — Synergy Trait\n§rAt the cost of rapid armor durability drain, boosts the efficiency of your Modular Machinery machines to 133.3%!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.specular_reflectionTrait.name=Specular Reflection
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.specular_reflectionTrait.desc=§oReflection and refraction coexist!\n§rWhen hit by magic, moderate chance to reflect 30% of the damage back to the attacker.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.phase_rushTrait.name=Phase Rush
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.phase_rushTrait.desc=§oTear through space!\n§rPress the hotkey to dash forward 7 blocks, binding and heavily damaging enemies at the center of your path! (10-second cooldown)
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.apostle_of_collapseTrait.name=Apostle of Collapse
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.apostle_of_collapseTrait.desc=§oPower... rising!\n§rWhen taking damage, small chance to trigger the Herrscher's power — teleport in front of the attacker and strike with the Void Spear for massive damage!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.power_of_herrscherTrait.name=Power of Herrscher
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.power_of_herrscherTrait.desc=§oHerrscher Power!\n§rEnhances skills derived from Herrscher Essence Metals, and slightly increases damage reduction.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.shoggyTrait.name=Shoggy
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.shoggyTrait.desc=§o(Shoggoth sounds)\n§rEww~ How disgusting~
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.shoddy_workmanshipTrait.name=Shoddy Workmanship
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.shoddy_workmanshipTrait.desc=§oQuality's a bit lacking.\n§rTriples durability consumption, but adds a small amount of defense.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.chorusTrait.name=Chorus
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.chorusTrait.desc=§oPun intended.\n§rYour armor automatically repairs based on the number of Chorus Fruit in your hotbar.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.consonantTrait.name=Consonant
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.consonantTrait.desc=§oDoes anyone actually fail to trigger this?\n§rIf your username contains consonants, negates 5% of damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.creeper_defenseTrait.name=Creeper Defense
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.creeper_defenseTrait.desc=§oStay away from explosions!\n§rSpends 5% armor durability to become immune to Creeper explosion damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.igneousTrait.name=Igneous
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.igneousTrait.desc=§oThe power of the three filler stones!\n§rWhen you take damage, chance to obtain Granite;\n§rWhen you jump, chance to obtain Diorite;\n§rWhen you sprint, chance to obtain Andesite.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.earthcrashTrait.name=Earthcrash
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.earthcrashTrait.desc=§oThe wrath of the earth!\n§rWhen attacked, small chance to break the block under you, then gain a brief Resistance boost.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.earthessenceTrait.name=Earthessence
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.earthessenceTrait.desc=§oThe essence of the earth!\n§rIncreases your defense based on the number of ores beneath your feet.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.earthspiritTrait.name=Earthspirit
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.earthspiritTrait.desc=§oThe call of the earth!\n§rWhen hit by a lethal attack, chance to summon a loyal zombie to protect you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.lifelinkTrait.name=Lifelink
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.lifelinkTrait.desc=§oLife flows both ways!\n§rWhen your HP ratio is lower than your attacker's, small chance to synchronize your HP ratio to match theirs!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.demon_decayTrait.name=Demon Decay
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.demon_decayTrait.desc=§oTotal withering\n§rWhen attacked, small chance to block part of the damage and render the attacker unconscious for a few seconds; mobs in this state drop no items.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.order_defenseTrait.name=Order Defense
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.order_defenseTrait.desc=§oPerfect order!\n§rDamage you take is alternately reduced or amplified in a fixed sequence.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.erodingTrait.name=Eroding
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.erodingTrait.desc=\n§rReduces the attacker's maximum health for a period of time.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.imitationTrait.name=Imitation
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.imitationTrait.desc=§oJust trying it out...\n§rYour armor gains 4 Simulation points that can be used in place of durability... it restores one point every 25 seconds.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.star_orbitTrait.name=Star Orbit
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.star_orbitTrait.desc=§oA binary star system (absolutely)\n§oWhat else did you think I was talking about?\n§rDamage from the two most recent attackers is greatly reduced... but once a third arrives, it's like a three-body problem — BOOM!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ingeniousTrait.name=Ingenious
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ingeniousTrait.desc=§oHollow within, straight without — no vines, no branches\n§rThis armor can consume dirt to repair itself.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ingenious_boneTrait.name=Ingenious Bone
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ingenious_boneTrait.desc=§oAn unconventional exoskeleton\n§rThis armor can consume dirt, then grant you Regeneration.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.floatwalkTrait.name=Float Walk
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.floatwalkTrait.desc=§oIts density is lower than water!\n§rWhile in water, you are permanently pushed upward (similar to a bubble column effect).
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.erebuslessTrait.name=Erebusless
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.erebuslessTrait.desc=§oStay far from The Defiled Lands!\n§rReduces damage taken while in The Defiled Lands or from The Defiled Lands mobs.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ecological2Trait.name=Ecological II
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ecological2Trait.desc=§oGreen energy!\n§rRenewable resources are great, they repair themselves automatically!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dreadpurityTrait.name=Dread Purity
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dreadpurityTrait.desc=§oPurify the dread!\n§rReduces damage from mobs infected with Dread Plague.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dreadplagueTrait.name=Dread Plague
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dreadplagueTrait.desc=§oSpread the dread!\n§rWhen attacked, inflicts Dread Plague on the attacker.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.coraliumplagueTrait.name=Coralium Plague
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.coraliumplagueTrait.desc=§oSpread the Coralium Plague!\n§rWhen attacked, inflicts Coralium Plague on the attacker.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.warpTrait.name=Warp
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.warpTrait.desc=§oSpace warped!\n§rThis equipment can shrink your hitbox (minimum 0.4×0.4).
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.thallium_poisonTrait.name=Thallium Poison
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.thallium_poisonTrait.desc=§oI am the potassium ion.\n§rWhen attacked, high chance to inflict severe Poison on the attacker (though wearing it isn't great for you either)!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.erebus_walkerTrait.name=Erebus Walker
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.erebus_walkerTrait.desc=§oNo more sinking into mud.\n§rIncreases movement speed in The Defiled Lands, and makes you immune to the slowdown from muddy terrain.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bloodriseTrait.name=Blood Rise
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bloodriseTrait.desc=§oCast a soul with blood!\n§r50% chance to restore LP when attacked.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bloodcurseTrait.name=Blood Curse
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.bloodcurseTrait.desc=§oBlood for blood!\n§rEach time you're attacked, you lose 10% LP, but damage taken is reduced.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.atum_visionTrait.name=Atum Vision
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.atum_visionTrait.desc=§oSeeing light again.\n§rImproves your visibility in the Atum dimension.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.craven_survivalismTrait.name=Craven Survivalism
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.craven_survivalismTrait.desc=§oBetter to live ignobly than die nobly\n§rWhen damaged, you throw off this armor and become immune to that hit (3% chance the armor disappears entirely).
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.exskeletalTrait.name=Exskeletal
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.exskeletalTrait.desc=§oPerhaps one extra finger!\n§rAdds a ring slot to your trinket inventory!
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.force_redirectionTrait.name=Force Redirection
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.force_redirectionTrait.desc=§oForce transfer!\n§rWhen attacked, small chance to redirect part of the damage to nearby blocks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.jadedTrait.name=Jaded
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.jadedTrait.desc=§oCat\n§rIncreases the amount of health you restore.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.nestingTrait.name=Nesting
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.nestingTrait.desc=§oA warm home\n§rWhen more than 4 non-full-block blocks are adjacent to you, blocks 30% of damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.seriesTrait.name=Series
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.seriesTrait.desc=§oInfinite series!§r\n§fAfter being hit, subsequent damage within a period of time is multiplied by a geometric series of coefficients until damage falls below 1.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.rationalityTrait.name=Rationality
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.rationalityTrait.desc=§oStay rational!§r\n§fThe more Warping you have, the more damage you take; at 0 Warping, you take 10% less damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dragon_bodyTrait.name=Dragon Body
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.dragon_bodyTrait.desc=§oDragon Body!§r\n§fEach armor piece provides 20% flight damage reduction.\nSet bonus:\n2 pieces: each piece grants an extra 30% movement speed.\n3 pieces: each piece grants Regeneration I.\n4 pieces: left-clicking while empty-handed consumes 5 durability from each piece to release Chaos Dragon Breath dealing 5% of targets' max health to all non-player targets within 5 blocks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.sukhavatiTrait.name=Sukhavati
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.sukhavatiTrait.desc=§oPure Land Trial.§r\n§fThe first time you're hit, enter "Sukhavati" for 15 seconds and become immune to that hit; damage taken during this time is negated and counted as wounds, kills are counted as kills. When the effect ends naturally, if wounds exceed kills you suffer fatal backlash (instantly lethal if dispelled).
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.hexable_basementTrait.name=Hexable Basement
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.hexable_basementTrait.desc=§oMelt all things into one furnace!\n§rYour armor can store all six basic Thaumcraft aspects simultaneously and use them to enhance your armor.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.hexaelementalTrait.name=Hexaelemental
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.hexaelementalTrait.desc=§oThe power of the elements!\n§rYour armor gains different defense effects based on its current rotation state.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.spirit_powerTrait.name=Spirit Power
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.spirit_powerTrait.desc=§oGather some inspiration first.\n§rMystic items in your hotbar will work for you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aquabaseTrait.name=Aquabase
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aquabaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Water!\n§rThis armor's element rotation will switch to the Water Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ignisbaseTrait.name=Ignisbase
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ignisbaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Fire!\n§rThis armor's element rotation will switch to the Fire Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.terrabaseTrait.name=Terrabase
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.terrabaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Earth!\n§rThis armor's element rotation will switch to the Earth Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aerbaseTrait.name=Aerbase
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.aerbaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Air!\n§rThis armor's element rotation will switch to the Air Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ordobaseTrait.name=Ordobase
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ordobaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Order!\n§rThis armor's element rotation will switch to the Order Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.perditiobaseTrait.name=Perditiobase
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.perditiobaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Entropy!\n§rThis armor's element rotation will switch to the Entropy Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.brightestTrait.name=Brightest
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.brightestTrait.desc=§oCapture every eye in the room§r\n§fThe more white on your armor, the less damage you take.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ender_replacementTrait.name=Ender Replacement
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ender_replacementTrait.desc=§oShadow Escape: End Stone Substitution!\n§rWhen you take damage, if there is a 2-block-high End Stone area nearby, you teleport to it and become immune to that hit.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.discountedTrait.name=Discounted
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.discountedTrait.desc=§oLikes are free for everyone\n§rSignificantly increases the durability restored when repairing armor.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ascension_swearingTrait.name=Ascension Swearing
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.ascension_swearingTrait.desc=§oThe energy of 30+ worlds has gathered here.\n§rImmune to part of the damage dealt by vanilla mobs.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.eruditeTrait.name=Erudite
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.eruditeTrait.desc=§oLearning never ends.\n§rThe more Thaumcraft Theory research points you have, the less damage you take.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.frame_of_esportTrait.name=Frame of Esport
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.frame_of_esportTrait.desc=§oOne frame: playable; two: smooth; three: pro-level\n§rThe maximum damage you take in one hit cannot exceed your current FPS squared.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.right_translationTrait.name=Right Translation
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.right_translationTrait.desc=§oSo whose fault is it, exactly?\n§rCan trigger some weird... translation quirks?
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.asteroidTrait.name=Asteroid
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.asteroidTrait.desc=§oLu Xun: I never said that.\n§rWhen you jump, nearby targets take damage equal to your armor value and are set on fire.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.additionsTrait.name=Additions
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.additionsTrait.desc=§oStill valid!\n§rIf you are a Greedycraft I sponsor, your armor will be slightly enhanced.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.smoke_checkerTrait.name=Smoke Checker
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.smoke_checkerTrait.desc=§oI wonder if there's any radioactive material in there?\n§rThe higher the radiation level of the chunk, the less damage you take.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.fault_tolerantTrait.name=Fault Tolerant
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.fault_tolerantTrait.desc=§oThere's plenty of room to breathe!\n§rDamage you take is rounded down to two significant figures.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.lagTrait.name=Lag
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.lagTrait.desc=§oL a g  o u t\n§rMost of the damage you take this time is stored in your armor; the next time you take damage, part of that stored total is dealt — overall, you still take less damage than normal.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.reversed_visionTrait.name=Reversed Vision
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.reversed_visionTrait.desc=§oThe opposite of light.\n§rAllows you to trade with the Reversed Phase Elf Elder.
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.brandTrait.name=Brand
greedycraft.tconstruct.armor_trait.brandTrait.desc=§oKeep going!\n§rReduces damage taken based on total armor toughness.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.venge_attractionTrait.name=Venge Attraction
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.venge_attractionTrait.desc=§oWhat are you looking at?\n§rDoubles damage dealt to targets that are not aggro'd on you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.energy_overstockTrait.name=Energy Overstock
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.energy_overstockTrait.desc=§oEnergy overload!\n§rYour tool continuously accumulates energy; attacks consume energy to deal greater damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fault_tolerantTrait.name=Fault Tolerant
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fault_tolerantTrait.desc=§oThere's plenty of room to breathe!\n§rDamage you deal is rounded up to two significant figures.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.pioneerTrait.name=Pioneer
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.pioneerTrait.desc=§oI'll stake my claim here!\n§rAfter killing 3 mobs, you can set a block as an anchor; the closer you are to the anchor, the higher your attack power.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.smoke_checkerTrait.name=Smoke Checker
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.smoke_checkerTrait.desc=§oI wonder if there's any radioactive material in there?\n§rThe higher the radiation level of the chunk, the higher your attack power.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.backTrait.name=Back
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.backTrait.desc=§oA regret eraser!\n§rWhen you die while holding this tool, it records your death location; sneak-right-click to teleport back there (once per death).
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ichorTrait.name=Ichor
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ichorTrait.desc=§oThe curse of Ichor.\n§rThis tool's mining level is locked at 4.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.additionsTrait.name=Additions
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.additionsTrait.desc=§oStill valid!\n§rIf you are a Greedycraft I sponsor, your tool will be slightly enhanced.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.punishment_of_tcTrait.name=Punishment of TC
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.punishment_of_tcTrait.desc=§oThis is illegal!\n§rThis item's stats are greatly reduced.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.dimensional_strikeTrait.name=Dimensional Strike
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.dimensional_strikeTrait.desc=§oDependant on reality.\n§rThe lower the server's TPS, the higher the damage dealt.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bouncy_stringTrait.name=Bouncy String
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bouncy_stringTrait.desc=§oFull of spring!\n§rFor bows with long draw times, greatly reduces the draw time.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.eruditeTrait.name=Erudite
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.eruditeTrait.desc=§oLearning never ends.\n§rThe more Thaumcraft Theory research points you have, the more damage you deal.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ascension_swearingTrait.name=Ascension Swearing
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ascension_swearingTrait.desc=§oThe energy of 30+ worlds has gathered here.\n§rDamage to vanilla mobs is greatly increased!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.discountedTrait.name=Discounted
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.discountedTrait.desc=§oLikes are free for everyone\n§rSignificantly increases the durability restored when repairing this tool.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.breedTrait.name=Breed
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.breedTrait.desc=§oEndless life!\n§rThis tool's attack power is reduced to 30%, but can continuously deal multiple hits to a target.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.brightestTrait.name=Brightest
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.brightestTrait.desc=§oCapture every eye in the room§r\n§fThe more white on your tool, the more damage you deal.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.aquabaseTrait.name=Aquabase
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.aquabaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Water!\n§rThis tool's element rotation will switch to the Water Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ignisbaseTrait.name=Ignisbase
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ignisbaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Fire!\n§rThis tool's element rotation will switch to the Fire Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.terrabaseTrait.name=Terrabase
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.terrabaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Earth!\n§rThis tool's element rotation will switch to the Earth Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.aerbaseTrait.name=Aerbase
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.aerbaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Air!\n§rThis tool's element rotation will switch to the Air Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ordobaseTrait.name=Ordobase
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ordobaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Order!\n§rThis tool's element rotation will switch to the Order Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.perditiobaseTrait.name=Perditiobase
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.perditiobaseTrait.desc=§oFoundation of Entropy!\n§rThis tool's element rotation will switch to the Entropy Element state every 6 ticks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.spirit_powerTrait.name=Spirit Power
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.spirit_powerTrait.desc=§oGather some inspiration first.\n§rMystic items in your hotbar will work for you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.return_to_earthTrait.name=Return to Earth
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.return_to_earthTrait.desc=§oAll things in life will eventually return to the earth.\n§rYou can convert killed mobs into Chunk Vis.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.hexable_basementTrait.name=Hexable Basement
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.hexable_basementTrait.desc=§oMelt all things into one furnace!\n§rYour tool can store all six basic Thaumcraft aspects simultaneously and use them to enhance your tool.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.hexaelementalTrait.name=Hexaelemental
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.hexaelementalTrait.desc=§oThe power of the elements!\n§rYour tool gains different strike effects based on its current rotation state.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.coulomb_explosionTrait.name=Coulomb Explosion
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.coulomb_explosionTrait.desc=§oThis is why alkali metals explode in water...\n§rAfter hitting an enemy, small chance to trigger a secondary explosion.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.calculusTrait.name=Calculus
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.calculusTrait.desc=§oMathematical analysis!§r\n§fCalculates DPS over ten attacks; the next attack deals true damage equal to the original damage plus the DPS value.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.rationalityTrait.name=Rationality
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.rationalityTrait.desc=§oStay rational!§r\n§fThe more Warping you have, the less damage you deal; at 0 Warping, you deal 10% more damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ant_summoningTrait.name=Ant Summoning
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ant_summoningTrait.desc=§oA tiny helper!\n§rWhen attacking, small chance to summon a black ant to assist you, then briefly boost your attack damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.strong_liftTrait.name=Strong Lift
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.strong_liftTrait.desc=§oLift the heavy load!\n§rWhen attacking targets below you, launch them straight up into the air.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.jadeitizationTrait.name=Jadeitization
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.jadeitizationTrait.desc=§oIt's starting to harden!\n§rKilling mobs drops some Jade Berries.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.collisionTrait.name=Collision
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.collisionTrait.desc=§oEntomophobia!\n§rAttacks deal strong knockback and apply powerful Weakness to the target.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.heatstrokeTrait.name=Heatstroke
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.heatstrokeTrait.desc=§oThe sun is making my head spin!\n§rWhen using this tool in a hot biome, you can overdraft your stamina (damage x2.5)... at the cost of temporarily halving your max health.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.craven_survivalismTrait.name=Craven Survivalism
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.craven_survivalismTrait.desc=§oBetter to live ignobly than die nobly\n§rWhen damaged, you throw off this tool and become immune to that hit.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.insect_eaterTrait.name=Insect Eater
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.insect_eaterTrait.desc=§oThis stuff has five times the protein of beef!\n§rKilling mobs in The Defiled Lands restores your food bar.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bloodriseTrait.name=Blood Rise
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bloodriseTrait.desc=§oCast a soul with blood!\n§r50% chance to restore LP after dealing damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bloodcurseTrait.name=Blood Curse
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bloodcurseTrait.desc=§oBlood for blood!\n§rEach attack costs you 10% LP, but deals extra damage to the target.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.archaeologistTrait.name=Archaeologist
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.archaeologistTrait.desc=§oDig through history!\n§rYour attack power changes based on your altitude.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.thallium_poisonTrait.name=Thallium Poison
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.thallium_poisonTrait.desc=§oI am the potassium ion.\n§rWhen attacking, small chance to inflict severe Poison and randomly remove positive effects from the target.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.poison_smogTrait.name=Poison Smog
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.poison_smogTrait.desc=§oPoison mist spreads.\n§rKilling mobs generates a radius-3 potion cloud (Poison X, 10s); attacking unpoisoned targets applies Poison VIII for 5s; already-poisoned targets take 20-40% more damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.warpTrait.name=Warp
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.warpTrait.desc=§oSpace warped!\n§rThis tool enlarges the hitbox of attacked targets (maximum 2.0x2.0x2.0).
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ecological2Trait.name=Ecological II
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ecological2Trait.desc=§oGreen energy!\n§rRenewable resources are great, they repair themselves automatically!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bane_of_erebusTrait.name=Bane of Erebus
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bane_of_erebusTrait.desc=§oCalamity of The Defiled Lands!\n§rDeals massive damage to mobs in The Defiled Lands.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ingeniousTrait.name=Ingenious
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ingeniousTrait.desc=§oHollow within, straight without — no vines, no branches\n§rYour tool can consume dirt to repair itself.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.solarys_refinedTrait.name=Solarys Refined
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.solarys_refinedTrait.desc=§oThe light of the sun!\n§rAllows your tool to mine Solarys ore.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.stellar_fusionTrait.name=Stellar Fusion
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.stellar_fusionTrait.desc=§oFour hydrogen atoms fuse into one helium!\n§rIf your tool has four of the same "Stellar Fusion" traits, your attacks are greatly boosted!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.imitationTrait.name=Imitation
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.imitationTrait.desc=§oJust trying it out...\n§rYour tool gains 10 Simulation points that can be used in place of durability... it restores one point every ten seconds.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.order_attackTrait.name=Order Attack
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.order_attackTrait.desc=§oPerfect order!\n§rYour attacks are alternately amplified or reduced in a fixed sequence.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.soul_flagTrait.name=Soul Flag
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.soul_flagTrait.desc=§oDevious methods.\n§rMob souls attached to your weapon inflict Bleeding on enemies, but also make the tool more fragile... fortunately, you can inject souls into other mobs to mitigate this drawback.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.lifelinkTrait.name=Lifelink
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.lifelinkTrait.desc=§oLife flows both ways!\n§rWhen your HP ratio is lower than your target's, small chance to synchronize your HP ratio to match theirs!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.demon_decayTrait.name=Demon Decay
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.demon_decayTrait.desc=§oTotal withering\n§rWhen attacking, small chance to render the target unconscious for a few seconds; mobs in this state drop no items.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.earthspiritTrait.name=Earthspirit
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.earthspiritTrait.desc=§oThe call of the earth!\n§rUpon killing a mob, revives it as a loyal zombie.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.earthessenceTrait.name=Earthessence
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.earthessenceTrait.desc=§oThe essence of the earth!\n§rIncreases your attack power based on the number of ores beneath your feet.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.earthcrashTrait.name=Earthcrash
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.earthcrashTrait.desc=§oThe wrath of the earth!\n§rWhen attacking, small chance to break the block under the target, making your weapon heavier.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.igneousTrait.name=Igneous
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.igneousTrait.desc=§oThe power of the three filler stones!\n§rWhen attacking, consume any of the three "filler stones" for the following effects:\nGranite: deal 1.5x damage on critical hits;\nDiorite: apply powerful knockback on critical hits;\nAndesite: increase crit chance by 30%.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fake_goldTrait.name=Fake Gold
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fake_goldTrait.desc=§oLooks just like gold!\n§rWhen mining copper ore, 50% chance to obtain gold ore instead.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.nitrationTrait.name=Nitration
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.nitrationTrait.desc=§oConvert it to gunpowder!\n§rKilling targets drops an extra piece of Gunpowder.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.chorusTrait.name=Chorus
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.chorusTrait.desc=§oPun intended.\n§rYour tool automatically repairs based on the number of Chorus Fruit in your hotbar.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.alcrystry_weakTrait.name=Crystallized
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.alcrystry_weakTrait.desc=§oUse the tool as a crystal core.\n§rAllows metals within ores to grow directly on your tool.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.shoggyTrait.name=Shoggy
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.shoggyTrait.desc=§o(Shoggoth sounds)\n§rEww~ How disgusting~
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.power_of_herrscherTrait.name=Power of Herrscher
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.power_of_herrscherTrait.desc=§oHerrscher Power!\n§rEnhances skills derived from Herrscher Essence Metals, and slightly boosts attack damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.spaceshockTrait.name=Spaceshock
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.spaceshockTrait.desc=§oThis is the moment of judgment!\n§rRight-click a target from a distance to trigger a spacetime shock, dealing massive damage and binding the enemy!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.subspaceTrait.name=Subspace
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.subspaceTrait.desc=§oHonkai descends\n§rConsumes a certain amount of magic power, then summons the Void Spear to strike your enemy.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.alcrystryTrait.name=Alcrystry
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.alcrystryTrait.desc=§oNot a typo.\n§rEquivalent to an automatic x3 smelting boost, but only for ingots!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.flops_coreTrait.name=Flops Core
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.flops_coreTrait.desc=§oBut there's no research here...\n§bNova Engineering — Synergy Trait\n§rRight-click a Machine Controller in the Overworld to bind; right-click an anvil to unbind.\n§rCalculates max FLOPS based on tool durability; bound machines consume FLOPS to provide damage multipliers. Higher-tier machines give bigger bonuses while running. Damage becomes zero when FLOPS overflow.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.hydrogenationTrait.name=Hydrogenation
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.hydrogenationTrait.desc=§oHydrogen embrittlement effect!\n§bHydrogen Sky Island — Synergy Trait\n§rWhen landing a critical hit, extremely small chance to embrittle the target's armor, reducing its effectiveness by 40.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.spikyTrait.name=Spiky
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.spikyTrait.desc=§oPierce through everything!\n§rSummons a thorny spike beneath the target.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.rift_recoveryTrait.name=Rift Recovery
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.rift_recoveryTrait.desc=§oRepair with the Celestial Eye!\n§rAccumulate "Rift Energy" by attacking mobs in the Betweenlands while under the "Celestial Eye" state; this energy can convert Swamp Water into Mummy Sap when your Decay level is low!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.octibladeTrait.name=Octiblade
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.octibladeTrait.desc=§oThe upgraded version of Fiery Iron!\n§rWhen attacking, converts a portion of damage into triple fire damage based on your Decay level!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.calamityTrait.name=Calamity
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.calamityTrait.desc=§oCalamity strikes!\n§rWhen attacking, small chance to inflict random negative effects on the enemy.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.wight_rejectionTrait.name=Wight Rejection
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.wight_rejectionTrait.desc=§oSoul backlash!\n§rThe target you attack becomes prey for the wights around you.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.chomperTrait.name=Chomper
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.chomperTrait.desc=§oThe new era of [REDACTED]\n§rProvides a damage boost based on the number of flowers in your surroundings.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.abstractTrait.name=Abstract
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.abstractTrait.desc=§oThis is definitely not a good word.\n§rWhen the first decimal digit of damage dealt is 1, 4, or 7, that damage is halved.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.six_art_internetTrait.name=Six Art Internet
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.six_art_internetTrait.desc=§oThe mighty sage descends into the new era\n§rCan you feel the allure of cyber-winism?
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.world_beginningTrait.name=World Beginning
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.world_beginningTrait.desc=§oWelcome to the new world.\n§rFor a period after entering a new dimension, increases tool damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.burn_bridgesTrait.name=Burn Bridges
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.burn_bridgesTrait.desc=§oThis final battle — fight to the last!\n§rWhen your HP percentage is lower than your target's, increases attack damage by 40%!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.emberTrait.name=Ember
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.emberTrait.desc=§oMake the most of what's left!\n§rUses durability to compensate for combat power.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.rekindledTrait.name=Rekindled
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.rekindledTrait.desc=§oWild fire rises again.\n§rRestores a large amount of durability while burning.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.wavecrestTrait.name=Wavecrest
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.wavecrestTrait.desc=§oThe highest point.\n§rDuplicate traits grant you extra damage bonuses!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.wavetroughTrait.name=Wavetrough
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.wavetroughTrait.desc=§oThe lowest point.\n§rWhen you're in a tough spot, there's always some benefit.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.polarizationTrait.name=Polarization
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.polarizationTrait.desc=§oOptical activity!\n§rYour damage type may change... ?
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.loveTrait.name=Love
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.loveTrait.desc=§oDamare! No funny business!\n§rCupid's Arrow!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.enhancedTrait.name=Enhanced
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.enhancedTrait.desc=§oShining bright!\n§rAdds 2 upgrade slots.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overmeltTrait.name=Overmelt
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overmeltTrait.desc=§oHot glue gun!\n§rMassively increases damage to slime-type mobs!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overglueTrait.name=Overglue
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overglueTrait.desc=§oWooah, I can't move...\n§rStick their feet to the ground!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overbreakTrait.name=Overbreak
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overbreakTrait.desc=§o...until death do us part.\n§rIn destruction, there is new life...
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overattackTrait.name=Overattack
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overattackTrait.desc=§oBreak their defenses!\n§rConsumes slime coat to convert part of the damage to spell damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.unshapedTrait.name=Unshaped
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.unshapedTrait.desc=§oGrant me rebirth...\n§rRapidly restores durability, but only in the Betweenlands.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.pureTrait.name=Pure
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.pureTrait.desc=§oPure as snow...\n§rTempers the weapon with life.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bedrockTrait.name=Bedrock
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bedrockTrait.desc=§oImmovable as bedrock!\n§rYour tool only has a 15% chance to consume durability.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.globiomeTrait.name=Globiome
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.globiomeTrait.desc=§oTime to explorrrrrre\n§rBiomes you've visited will strengthen your tool!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.leveling_durabilityTrait.name=Leveling Durability
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.leveling_durabilityTrait.desc=§oNow say: Thanks ED!\n§rTool durability loss is affected by game difficulty.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.turning_downTrait.name=Turning Down
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.turning_downTrait.desc=§oHuh? Easter egg!\n§rAttacks flip enemies upside-down; flipped targets take more damage!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.finiteTrait.name=Finite
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.finiteTrait.desc=§oEverything stop!\n§rReduces the target's armor!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.parallelingTrait.name=Paralleling
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.parallelingTrait.desc=§oWhat? You did this on purpose?\n§rWhen mining a block, also mines surrounding blocks of the same type.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.panoramaTrait.name=Panorama
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.panoramaTrait.desc=§oAll-encompassing.\n§rWorks better against non-vanilla mobs and blocks.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.wyvernTrait.name=Wyvern
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.wyvernTrait.desc=§oIs this literally a specialized weapon?\n§rCounters the Ender Dragon!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.draconicTrait.name=Draconic
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.draconicTrait.desc=§oStronger and more precise.\n§rBe a better dragonslayer.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.chaoticTrait.name=Chaotic
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.chaoticTrait.desc=§oRight tool for the job!\n§rIncreases damage dealt to the Ender Dragon and Chaos Guardian!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fallenTrait.name=Fallen
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fallenTrait.desc=§oIs this literally a specialized weapon?\n§rCounters the Wither!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.relifedTrait.name=Relifed
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.relifedTrait.desc=§oStronger and more precise.\n§rBe a better §mWither-slayer§r.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.stormyTrait.name=Stormy
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.stormyTrait.desc=§oRight tool for the job 2.0!\n§rIncreases damage dealt to the Wither and Wither Storm (requires Command Delete to unlock)!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.orderedTrait.name=Ordered
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.orderedTrait.desc=§oNice, balanced.\n§rIncreases damage to bosses by 50%!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.erase_commandTrait.name=Erase Command
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.erase_commandTrait.desc=§oCommand all things!\n§rDeals massive damage to the Wither Storm!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overdominateTrait.name=Overdominate
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.overdominateTrait.desc=§oI am the master of slime!\n§rYour slime coat provides extra damage!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.slowdownTrait.name=Slowdown
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.slowdownTrait.desc=§oAbsorb the radiation!\n§rReduces the "Active Source" attribute by half.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.maze_breakerTrait.name=Maze Breaker
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.maze_breakerTrait.desc=§oOh no, my review copy!\n§rInstantly breaks maze blocks without consuming durability.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fracture2Trait.name=Fracture II
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fracture2Trait.desc=§oYou're going to dig a very deep hole!\n§rDo you have a drill or something? (More stable)
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fractureTrait.name=Fracture
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fractureTrait.desc=§oYou're going to dig a very deep hole!\n§rDo you have a drill or something?
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.flyingbutterflyTrait.name=Flying Butterfly
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.flyingbutterflyTrait.desc=§oSorrow of the dead, fear of death, branded upon it§r\nBoosts various speeds
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.solemnlamentTrait.name=Solemn Lament
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.solemnlamentTrait.desc=§oSolemn mourning proclamation!§r\nThe first attack deals 50% damage and marks the target; the second attack removes the mark and deals 165% erosion damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.sharper_harvestingTrait.name=Sharper Harvesting
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.sharper_harvestingTrait.desc=§oA pickaxe strike? That's not all!\n§rIncreases the damage of mining tools.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.parasitismTrait.name=Parasitism
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.parasitismTrait.desc=§oConsumes your tool!\n§bParasite Tech — Synergy Trait\n§rOccupies the slots of other Tinkers' traits... to sustain itself\n§oDevours other traits; becomes void if any component is replaced — choose your build carefully.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ender_lordTrait.name=Ender Lord
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.ender_lordTrait.desc=§oYou will dominate the Enders.\n§rDeals massive damage to Ender-type mobs!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.radianceTrait.name=Radiance
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.radianceTrait.desc=§oSplash!\n§rYour attacks emit a radiant glow that damages nearby enemies.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.extra_healthTrait.name=Extra Health
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.extra_healthTrait.desc=§oA true miracle worker!\n§rWhen durability is consumed, chance to restore a large amount of durability...
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.stackedTrait.name=Stacked
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.stackedTrait.desc=§oChain it together!\n§rYour armor value provides extra bonus damage for this attack.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.malevolenceTrait.name=Malevolence
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.malevolenceTrait.desc=§oWhich boss is this from?\n§rWhen attacking, small chance to drain your own health.\n§rThis seems... undesirable.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.betweenland_controllerTrait.name=Betweenland Controller
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.betweenland_controllerTrait.desc=§oI am the lord!\n§rAgainst Betweenlands mobs... give no quarter.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fragmentationTrait.name=Fragmentation
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fragmentationTrait.desc=§oShattered to pieces!\n§rWhen attacking, your weapon might drop some things...
