greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.amaratsuTrait.desc=§oThe power of the sun!\n§rThe closer the time is to noon, the higher the damage bonus!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.levitatedTrait.name=Levitated
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.levitatedTrait.desc=§oThe Overworld has been destroyed... sorry, wrong channel.\n§bWeightlessness — Synergy Trait\n§rAttacks apply Slow Falling to the target; deals increased damage to already-floating targets.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.radiatedTrait.name=Radiated
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.radiatedTrait.desc=§oR a d i a t e d  I s l a n d  B o y\n§rThe higher your radiation level, the more damage you deal.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.compressionTrait.name=Compression
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.compressionTrait.desc=§oSelf-aggregation?\n§rMining coal gives you diamonds.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.suicideTrait.name=Suicide
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.suicideTrait.desc=§oWhose life is it taking?...\n§rDoubles your attack power, but has a small chance to kill you instantly!\n§c(Do not use this trait in Hardcore mode!)
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.murderTrait.name=Murder
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.murderTrait.desc=§oStop it!\n§rMassively increases damage to unrecognized entities.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.charitableTrait.name=Charitable
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.charitableTrait.desc=§oSoft-heartedness is not a virtue in battle!\n§rAfter repeatedly attacking the same type of mob, damage greatly decreases.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.adjustment_of_placesTrait.name=Adjustment of Places
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.adjustment_of_placesTrait.desc=§oH a p p y  O l d  H o m e\n§rIncreases damage by 30% in the three vanilla dimensions.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.final_woundTrait.name=Final Wound
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.final_woundTrait.desc=§oThe complexity of this thing far exceeds your imagination...\n§r10% chance on attack to reduce the target's max health by 2%; ineffective on bosses.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.dragon_roaringTrait.name=Dragon Roaring
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.dragon_roaringTrait.desc=§oThe dominance of the ancient dragon!\n§rDeals extra Void damage to enemies above half health; ineffective on bosses.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.criticalityTrait.name=Criticality
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.criticalityTrait.desc=§oI heard that if you join two U-235 hemispheres together...\n§rIncreases the target's radiation level.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.easier_brokenTrait.name=Easier Broken
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.easier_brokenTrait.desc=§oThere's always a trade-off?\n§rThe higher the item's max durability, the lower its damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.transitionTrait.name=Transition
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.transition2Trait.name=Transition II
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.transitionTrait.desc=§oEnergy level interleaving!\n§rAttacks alternate between "Ground State" (lower damage) and "Excited State" (higher damage)!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.tiredTrait.name=Tired
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.tiredTrait.desc=§oGiving up——\n§rAfter mining 10 consecutive identical blocks, mining speed drops to 1% of its original speed; mining a different block resets the speed.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.air_controlTrait.name=Air Control
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.air_control2Trait.name=Air Control II
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.air_controlTrait.desc=§oI have the high ground!\n§rWhen the player's elevation is below the target's, increases attack damage slightly.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.sweepTrait.name=Sweep
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.sweepTrait.desc=§oWow\n§rIf you mine the same block type as the last one, mining speed increases — stackable infinitely. (But if the block type changes, speed resets)
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.active_sourceTrait.name=Active Source
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.active_source2Trait.name=Active Source II
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.active_source3Trait.name=Active Source III
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.active_source4Trait.name=Active Source IV
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.active_source5Trait.name=Active Source V
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.active_source6Trait.name=Active Source VI
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.active_sourceTrait.desc=§oShare the radiation!\n§rThis equipment is radioactive!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.soul_eaterTrait.name=Soul Eater
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.soul_eater2Trait.name=Soul Eater II
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.soul_eater3Trait.name=Soul Eater III
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.soul_eater4Trait.name=Soul Eater IV
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.soul_eater5Trait.name=Soul Eater V
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.soul_eaterTrait.desc=§oBrand new, reset version.\n§rThe more enemies you kill, the higher your damage — but there's a cap.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.aura_effectTrait.name=Aura Effect
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.aura_effectTrait.desc=§oIt'll help you recover...\n§rWhen the chunk's Aura is too low, increases your attack damage.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.manipulateTrait.name=Manipulate
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.manipulateTrait.desc=§oAs opposed to "Gamble"...§r\n§fIf the mob type you're attacking is one of the last 5 types you killed, deals double damage!
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.disarmTrait.name=Disarm
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.disarmTrait.desc=§oDisarm!\n§rSteals the target's equipment! But... only works on non-players.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bloodlustTrait.desc=§oThe weaker you are, the stronger I am! §r\n§fDeal additional damage depending on the percentage of health that the target has lost.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.bloodlustTrait.name=Bloodlust
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.cotlifestealTrait.desc=§oYour life is mine!§r\n§fGain a small amount of health when attacking, doesn't work on undead mobs.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.cotlifestealTrait.name=Life Steal
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.cotlifesteal2Trait.name=Life Steal II
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.crystalTrait.desc=§oKeep your tool shiny!§r\n§fDeals higher damage when at almost full durability, but decreases damage when at low durability.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.crystalTrait.name=Crystal Force
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.executionerTrait.desc=§oMeet your end!§r\n§fDirectly kills the opponent that has less than 20% (10% for bosses) of health.
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.executionerTrait.name=Executioner
greedycraft.tconstruct.tool_trait.fortifiedTrait.desc=§oThicc armor!§r\n§fGet resistant II effect when successfully blocking attacks.
